      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRIGGER POINT (4) jumped from box 6 last time and ran away with an impressive win scoring by 8 lengths at this track in a handy 29.88. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. GABBY GIRL (3) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind BLACKJACK TABLE (30.38) in a Maiden. Settled off speed and worked to the line nicely. Expected to feature again. GO WHISKEY GO (2) was game in defeat off a low draw at the latest outing, finishing second and beaten 2 lengths (19.22) behind Bit Unsure at Q Straight. Expected to feature. BUFFALO THEORY (1) can fill a top-three spot.",
